// spec/security/privacy.md, "Read authorization comes from the current case roles and is audited before delivery"; spec/security/evidence.md, "References, permanent admission and pending uploads are separate"; spec/security/intake.md, "A new attempt binds authenticated identity, passes admission and keeps its idempotency key"; spec/security/admission.md, "A signed service request binds method, path, timestamp and body digest and is refused outside a five-minute window"; spec/security/enforcement.md, "Clearance and restrictions are separate dimensions with their own records"; spec/security/screening.md, "Routing writes only private references for the current qualified version"; spec/security/routineDecisions.md, "The pass reads only an unappealed undecided report once per case revision and mode"; spec/security/reportDeposit.md, "A deposit is asked only with a new case, at a rate in force, from a reporter who is not exempt"; spec/backend/projectComposition.md, "Scans are queued and recorded against the project's current repositories"
